\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ἠ͡γ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ᾶ͡ν͡τ\u003C/span>ο \u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ἀ͡ν\u003C/span>θρώ-\u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"underline\">πινον\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan class=\"underline\">τὰ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan class=\"underline\">\u003Cspan class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">θ\u003C/span>(ε)\u003Cspan class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ῶ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ν\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan class=\"underline\">\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ἐ\u003C/span>νθάδ\u003C/span>’ [ἐ]μέ. εὐψύχ\u003Cspan class=\"small\" title=\"small character: ι\">ι\u003C/span> οὐδ\u003Cspan class=\"small\" title=\"small character: ὶ\">ὶ\u003C/span>ς \u003Cspan class=\"small\" title=\"small character: ἀ\">ἀ\u003C/span>-\u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"underline\">θά\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ν͡α͡τ\u003C/span>ος\u003C/span> · \u003Cspan class=\"underline\">ταῦτα\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Οὐάλης\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"nomen\" data-text=\"Οὐάλης\">\u003Cspan class=\"underline\">Οὐάλ\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">η͡ς\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan class=\"underline\">μ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">ν͡ή\u003C/span>μ\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">η͡ς\u003C/span> χ\u003Cspan class=\"small\" title=\"small character: